Raise your Dark Whispers in radius 10 to a deafening crescendo for [3, 4, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, applying another stack and drowning out all thought.

Targets afflicted by Dark Whispers will have 20% higher chance to spawn hallucinations, and each time they take damage from your Dark Whispers or Sanity Warp they will take an additional [89%, 120%, 144%, 165%, 183% (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage as temporal damage.

The damage will improve with your Spellpower.
